      "title": "Now 29% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 4.7% to ₹137. The fair value is estimated to be ₹106, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 8.2% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has declined by 46%.",
